musicbox-web (this repository) adapts the work above: it compiles the unchanged
musicbox-core engine to WebAssembly and adds a browser player. These changes are
distributed under the same license, CC BY-SA 4.0.

The Dattorro plate reverb in musicbox-core is ported from Mutable Instruments
Eurorack by Émilie Gillet, licensed under MIT:
https://github.com/pichenettes/eurorack/blob/master/LICENSE
